# Ratna Bay

- Game rules go in `src/RatnaBay.Domain`. Never add MonoGame types there.
- `Game1` is the lifecycle coordinator. New screens, HUD, and overlays go in `src/RatnaBay.Game/Ui/`.
- Sample input only through `InputRouter`. Draw 2D UI only through `UiCanvas`.
- Hit-test and draw rectangles share `UiLayout`. Do not duplicate pixel numbers in `Game1` and a renderer.
- Do not revive `ParkedFeatures` or add a package without a focused spike.
- Validate with `.\verify.ps1` on Windows, or `dotnet test tests/RatnaBay.Domain.Tests` plus a Windows-targeted compile on Linux.
- Full contributor recipes live in `AGENTS.md`.
